            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for foolish, then the Marathi for famous."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: सुरक्षित",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सुरक्षित — surakṣit — \"safe\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सुरक्षित (surakṣit) is Sanskrit surakṣita, \"well protected\", taken over whole as a learned loan, a tatsama (CDIAL 13499). It is su-, \"well\", and rakṣita, \"guarded\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for this chapter."
            }
          ]
        },
